# Agent notes, local only (owner, 2026-09-21). The repo is public and these are
# working state, not deliverables: half-done work, measured design floors, the
# owner's own decisions. They stay on disk and are still the first files a session
# reads. WARNING: git is no longer their backup — if this machine loses them, they
# are gone, and a fresh clone of this repo will not have them.
contextwindows.md
CLAUDE.md
# The task queue, for the same reason (2026-11-14): it carries the owner's open decisions and
# half-done work, and a public repo is the wrong place for either.
TASKS.md
# The outcome log the next session greps before walking a path again (2026-11-14): same class,
# same reason. It deepens the no-backup problem in TASKS.md T8 — that is the owner's call, not this file's.
LESSONS.md
# The scan log and its coverage maps, for the same reason (2026-11-06): working state, not a
# deliverable. CLAUDE.md points at them.
tarama-kaydi.md
tarama-haritasi-*.md

# Exercise clips never enter this public repository (owner, 2026-10-13): they live in
# the private R2 bucket — see clips.js and scripts/upload-clips.mjs.
*.mp4
clips-catalogue.local.json
# Which clip is which movement stays on this machine too (owner, 2026-10-13: "Yalnız bu
# makinede"). clip-slugs.example.json shows the shape.
clip-slugs.json
# The T18 build spec, same class as the notes above (2026-11-14): the owner's design decisions and
# measured numbers for the rebuild. It is the file the build follows; it is not a deliverable.
tasarim-spec-*.md
# Skill strengthening packages waiting for the owner (/skill-improve). They belong in
# ~/Desktop/Projects/claude-skills/, but a session sandboxed to this repository cannot write there,
# so they are parked here until he moves them. Never part of the site.
skill-paketleri/
